F.4 Consistency with the band-limited injection index

Bruno et al. (§5.3) report $\alpha_{\rm inj}=0.7\pm0.2$ from the 675–1260 MHz band directly. Combined with $\alpha_{\rm int}=1.06$, this implies

\Delta=\alpha_{\rm int}-\alpha_{\rm inj}=0.36\pm0.20,
